.","cipher":null},{"seq":1275,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c424","house":"tiger","letter":"L476","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["F3","s-east","tiger-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"HORSE AT EAST FORD, STRENGTH 71. SEEN: RHINO BOWMEN, RHINO HORSE, KITE SECOND FOOT.","cipher":null},{"seq":1276,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c425","house":"tiger","letter":"L477","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["s-east","tiger-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"ELEPHANTS AT EAST FORD, STRENGTH 100. SEEN: RHINO BOWMEN, RHINO HORSE, KITE SECOND FOOT.","cipher":null},{"seq":1277,"t":6900,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1891,"retries":0},{"seq":1278,"t":6900,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 24/30. Doctrine suggests taking East Ford (F3) and making a friend. Kite and Tiger are near F3. I will move Rhino Arch/Cav to F3 to contest/secure it, and send a letter to Orchid to initiate the truce as per doctrine."},{"seq":1279,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c426","house":"rhino","letter":"L478","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry","n-east"],"depart":6900,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1280,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c427","house":"rhino","letter":"L479","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry","n-east"],"depart":6900,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1281,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c428","house":"rhino","letter":"L480","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west","orchid-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":1282,"t":6900,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":2021,"retries":0},{"seq":1283,"t":6900,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 24. My doctrine is to take the east ford (F3) early, which I failed to do. Now I must react to the captured Tiger letters. They mention movements towards or near East Ford (F3) and South Bank East (S-East). I should move my forces to intercept or secure F3. Kite inf-1"},{"seq":1284,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c429","house":"kite","letter":"L481","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1285,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c430","house":"kite","letter":"L482","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":6900,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1286,"t":6900,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1572,"retries":0},{"seq":1287,"t":6900,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Doctrine dictates holding F1 (West Ford). All my units are already at F1 (2w ago). I must maintain the hold and reinforce it. Rhino is near F1 (n-west)."},{"seq":1288,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c431","house":"orchid","letter":"L483","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1289,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c432","house":"orchid","letter":"L484","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1290,"t":6900,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1873,"retries":0},{"seq":1291,"t":6900,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"We are in the final watches (24/30). Doctrine demands taking the east ford (F3) and charging last watch. Tiger forces are concentrated at F3. Rhino and Kite have forces near F3. I must consolidate and prepare for the final push, prioritizing control of F3."},{"seq":1292,"t":6900,"type":"courier","id":"c433","house":"tiger","letter":"L485","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":7200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ PSOQ EKNI."},{"seq":